      "subject": "Sua consulta foi confirmada — {{company_name}}",
      "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:0;\">\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6c5ce7,#9b59b6);padding:24px;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;text-align:center;\">\n    {{#if company_logo}}<img src=\"{{company_logo}}\" alt=\"{{company_name}}\" style=\"max-height:40px;margin-bottom:12px;\" />{{/if}}\n    <h2 style=\"color:white;margin:0;font-size:20px;\">Consulta Confirmada</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:24px;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#333;\">Olá <strong>{{customer_name}}</strong>,</p>\n    <p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;\">Sua consulta foi confirmada com os seguintes detalhes:</p>\n    <div style=\"background:#f8f9fa;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #6c5ce7;margin:16px 0;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Serviço:</strong> {{service_name}}</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Data:</strong> {{appointment_date}}</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Horário:</strong> {{appointment_time}}</p>\n      {{#if location}}<p style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Local:</strong> {{location}}</p>{{/if}}\n      {{#if agent_name}}<p style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:14px;\"><strong>Atendido por:</strong> {{agent_name}}</p>{{/if}}\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#999;margin-top:20px;\">Se precisar cancelar ou reagendar, responda a este e-mail ou entre em contato pelo WhatsApp.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>"
